**Before modifying any file in this repository, read and obey, in this order:**

1. [`AGENTS.md`](AGENTS.md) - the single source of truth for every agent rule.
2. [`PRECISION_POLICY.md`](PRECISION_POLICY.md) - per-model precision and the fidelity gates.
3. [`CUDA_EXECUTION_POLICY.md`](CUDA_EXECUTION_POLICY.md) - CUDA / TensorRT execution rules.

Nothing is repeated here. If this file and `AGENTS.md` disagree, `AGENTS.md` wins.
